# Premium Visual System

Before changing UI in `interfaces/web`:

1. Read `skills/portfolio-visual-language/SKILL.md`
2. Match surface type to `skills/premium-card-system` or `skills/realtime-dashboard-motion`
3. Pages: `skills/editorial-layout-system` + adopt `styles/pageLayout.style.ts`
4. Refactors: `skills/frontend-architecture/SKILL.md`

## Non-negotiables

- Theme tokens only (`theme.elevation`, not ad-hoc rgba shadows)
- Motion from `motionPresets.ts` / `animations.ts`
- `surfaces.ts` mixins — no duplicate hover blocks per page
- Gate Framer route motion with `usePrefersReducedMotion`
- No inline styles in JSX

## MCP validation

After visual changes: Playwright at 375 / 768 / 1280, dark + light — `.cursor/rules/frontend-mcp.mdc`
